(property "Description" " | verified | Upper clamp returns to shunt reference, not Q6A VDD. Negative current is limited by 49.9 kΩ (26.7 kΩ + 23.2 kΩ); TLV3012B ground input clamp is explicitly rated for this limited negative current. ±30 V sustained foreign-DC envelope of this detector tap only; the assembled port is limited by the E2 bias branch (E4 notes, E4-06). Not lightning protection." (at 0 0 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (hide yes)))
