(property "Datasheet" "STACK §5.3; assembly boundary of external Uputronics 440 LNA and selected UHF antenna" (at 0 0 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (hide yes)))
(property "Description" "Functional antenna-side coax interface of the external A418 assembly; named center/shield ports are not physical PCB pad numbers. | module | This is the selected UHF antenna/feed connection to the LNA RF input, upstream of A418; J402 remains the handheld P2 connection downstream of the LNA.; The interface is assembly-owned. When A418 has its integral SMA input, this record identifies that existing input and its mating antenna feed; it is not an additional bulkhead, adaptor, PCB jack or purchase. Verify the received assembly connector and cable before mating." (at 0 0 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (hide yes)))
