(property "Description" "Board-side coax receptacle on the RF board top edge; CENTER/SHIELD are the renamed pads of the derived footprint (CENTER = pad 1, SHIELD = both pads 2). | module | Mates the U.FL plug of the J402 panel pigtail (Taoglas CAB.718). Carries the ch2 bias (4.3 V, TPS2553 limit 0.339 A max) outward: no U.FL current rating is published, so DC drop and heating at the bias current are E4-07 measurements.; Place at the E4_P2 node with C403, L403, R4420 and R4460: the detector RF tap R4420 stays ≤1 mm from this port (DC-01)." (at 0 0 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (hide yes)))
